            <ArticleTitle>Budesonide + formoterol: new dose regimen. Asthma attacks: a step backwards.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>57</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Using the budesonide + formoterol combination for both maintenance treatment of asthma and on-demand control of asthma attacks amounts to intensifying maintenance treatment. It is not a valid treatment objective, and is likely to confuse asthma patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
